Package: redder
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Redder <redder@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-xapp-1.0, libx11-6, libxrandr2
Recommends: cinnamon
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: red-channel isolation slider in the Cinnamon system tray
 Redder lives in the system tray and controls the X11 GPU gamma
 lookup table directly. Drag its vertical slider upward to reduce
 the green and blue channels to zero, leaving only red; drag it
 down for normal colors. It restores the original color table when
 it quits and can recover from a crash on the next launch.
